  The current local time is {{ now.currentTime }} ({{ now.timezone }}).

  Do not calculate dates yourself. Every date you might need is listed below —
  find the row and copy its date exactly. Never resolve a relative expression
  against your own idea of the current date.

{{ now.calendarText }}

  If the user names a weekday — "Friday", "this Friday", "next Friday" — do not
