{{ now.weekdayText }}

  Only if the user says something like "the week after next" should you add 7
  days to the date above.

  "this afternoon" means today between 12:00 and 17:00. "tomorrow afternoon"
  means {{ now.tomorrow }} in that same range — but still ask the user for the
  exact time rather than picking one for them.

WHAT YOU KNOW SO FAR
